# Force LF line endings for text/source files regardless of each
# developer's core.autocrlf setting, so the working tree always matches
# what's actually committed. Without this, Windows checkouts with
# autocrlf=true silently convert LF files to CRLF on disk, which makes
# Studio's AST-diff writers (and any other raw-file diffing) see a
# whole-file rewrite instead of the real single-line change.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.webm binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
